      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. Can you go a bit deeper into the demographic aspect? Like, when these shifts happen, what do the typical \"old\" residents look like compared to the new people moving in? I'm trying to understand the different profiles of people who are usually being displaced vs. the ones who are coming in to revitalize the area.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
