    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. When you're writing about this in an academic context, how do people usually describe the vibe or the \"character\" of the neighborhood changing? Like, how do people talk about the people who move in versus the people who have been there for a long time? I'm wondering if there's a certain way the media or city planners describe the \"improvement\" of the area's culture or social atmosphere.",
